"<strong>Q3.</strong> In the minimum mass disk, the solids at {#} AU are {#} g/cm². Use the isolation mass formula to find the largest body that grows there, and compare with Mars and Earth. What has to happen after the gas is gone to make Earth?",
"<strong>Q4.</strong> Why does the three times heavier disk make a giant, but the same disk with gas gone at {#} million years does not? What does that say about when Jupiter formed?",
